## Workflow Tier Decision Guide

| Factor | Simple | Standard | Enterprise |
|--------|--------|----------|------------|
| Team size | Solo | 1-3 | 4+ |
| Release isolation | No | Yes | Yes |
| Dev branch PR overhead | N/A | None | Required |
| Parallel feature branches | No | No | Yes |
| External visibility | No | Optional | Yes |
| Best for | Prototypes, spikes | Most projects | Large teams |

**Default**: Start with **Simple**. Upgrade to Standard when you need release isolation. Upgrade to Enterprise only when multiple agents need to work on separate features simultaneously.

