## Multi-Agent Coordination

**Key principle**: Worktrees are for parallel work, NOT branching strategy.

| Tier | Worktrees For |
|------|---------------|
| Simple | Multiple agents on `main` |
| Standard | Multiple agents on `dev` |
| Enterprise | Multiple agents on different features |

**Worktree commands:**
```bash
# Create
git worktree add ../{{PROJECT_NAME}}--[name] [branch]

# List
git worktree list

# Remove
git worktree remove ../{{PROJECT_NAME}}--[name]

# Prune stale
git worktree prune
```

