## CI/CD Workflows

### Branch Protection Enforcement (Standard/Enterprise only)

**enforce-main-pr-source.yml** - CRITICAL
- **Trigger**: Any PR to `main` branch
- **Purpose**: Enforce that main ONLY accepts PRs from `dev`
- **Status**: ✅ Must be in place from project start

### Standard Workflows

| Workflow | Triggers | Purpose | Duration |
|----------|----------|---------|----------|
| **validate.yml** | Pushes to dev/main | Linting, formatting, security scans | ~2-3min |
| **test.yml** | Pushes to dev/main | Unit + integration tests | ~3-5min |
| **build.yml** | Push to main branch | Build artifacts | ~5-8min |
| **deploy-staging.yml** | Push to dev | Deploy to staging | ~10-15min |
| **deploy-prod.yml** | Tags: `v*.*.*` | Deploy to production | ~15-20min |

